	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
		Passive: After Magic Missile hits 5 times consecutively, it deals additional damage equal to 200% of Magic Missile's damage and restores {1}% of lost [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力]. If Magic Missile directly kills an enemy, it also restores some [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力].
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill: Deals magic damage to the target.
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		When enabled, Ashen Witch lets Elaina use [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力]. Its base maximum equals vanilla maximum mana, and each point of maximum life removed by Ashen Witch grants 1 additional maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力]. Her extra life gain is reduced by 50%. When [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力] is insufficient, each 1% of maximum life restores 1% of maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力].
		[klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力] regenerates at a fixed combat rate, refills in about two seconds outside combat, and pauses for three seconds after taking damage. Mana potions do not restore it.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		Requires the Ashen Witch skill to be enabled.
		Activate the barrier just before taking damage. It reduces damage based on the life lost to Ashen Witch and consumes [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:魔力] equal to the damage blocked by the barrier.
		'''
	WindBladeSkill: Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
}

